{
  "note_title": "Stirling Formula via Euler-Maclaurin and Wallis Product",
  "classification": "theory",
  "summary_en": "This note derives the asymptotic expansion of \\(S_n=\\sum_{k\\le n}\\log k=\\log(n!)\\) using the Euler-Maclaurin formula, and then determines the constant term via the Wallis product. It also discusses an error term inequality related to Stirling's formula.",
  "problems": [
