      "statement_en": "Prove that\n\\[\nS_n:=\\sum_{k\\leq n}\\log(k)=n\\log(n)-n+\\frac{1}{2}\\log(n)+\\log(\\sqrt{2\\pi})+O(1/n).\n\\]",
      "statement_zh": "证明$$S_n:=\\sum_{k\\leq n}\\log(k)=n\\log(n)-n+\\frac{1}{2}\\log(n)+\\log(\\sqrt{2\\pi})+O(1/n)$$",
